WEBVTT

00:08.740 --> 00:15.340
<b>Dareka ga sutete-shimatta
kinou o hiroi-age</b>

00:15.340 --> 00:18.680
<b>Gamushara ni te o nobashita</b>

00:18.680 --> 00:21.980
<b>Kotae o tsukitsukete</b>

00:21.980 --> 00:27.440
<b>Nani o te ni iretemo manzoku
suru koto wa nai</b>

00:28.620 --> 00:34.560
<b>Fukuzatsu ni karanda kokoro no
sukima kara nigedase</b>

00:34.560 --> 00:36.630
<b>Sou sa, make a treasure</b>

00:36.630 --> 00:41.870
<b>Sabitsuita toki no naka ni
kimi no koe o kiku</b>

00:41.870 --> 00:44.910
<b>Kono mama todoketai</b>

00:44.910 --> 00:48.180
<b>Hikari no naka kimi ga matteru</b>

00:48.180 --> 00:51.810
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

00:51.810 --> 00:55.410
<b>ima sugu ni</b>

01:05.990 --> 01:08.030
<b>Dakara, make a treasure</b>

01:08.030 --> 01:13.270
<b>Sabitsuita kagami no naka
jibun o sagashite</b>

01:13.270 --> 01:16.370
<b>Kono te de tsukamitai</b>

01:16.370 --> 01:19.610
<b>Doko ni itemo kimi ga matteru</b>

01:19.610 --> 01:23.180
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

01:23.180 --> 01:25.840
<b>ima sugu ni</b>

01:32.790 --> 01:34.420
<b>What's the matter, everyone?</b>

01:36.530 --> 01:38.690
<b>You're unusually quiet today.</b>

01:39.900 --> 01:44.030
<b>Leave it. There are days
like this too sometimes.</b>

01:44.030 --> 01:46.640
<b>If you're suddenly trying to play
the literary youth,</b>

01:46.640 --> 01:48.270
<b>it doesn't suit you.</b>

01:48.270 --> 01:50.260
<b>Quit it. You're giving me goosebumps.</b>

01:50.940 --> 01:53.610
<b>Taking up a sober attitude
is all fine and good,</b>

01:53.610 --> 01:57.150
<b>but if you stay like that, your neighbor
is going to get bored.</b>

01:57.150 --> 01:58.610
<b>Right, Goku?</b>

01:59.610 --> 02:00.880
<b>Goku?</b>

02:00.880 --> 02:04.180
<b>Hey, what's the matter?
Did ya eat something funny?</b>

02:11.760 --> 02:13.530
<b>This bastard's</b>

02:13.530 --> 02:15.690
<b>sleeping with his eyes open.</b>

02:16.870 --> 02:19.000
<b>It's creepy, damn it!
Wake up, you monkey!</b>

02:19.000 --> 02:20.660
<b>Shut up! I'm going to kill you!</b>

02:25.940 --> 02:29.340
<b>He seems to have been
talking in his sleep.</b>

02:49.200 --> 02:52.100
<b>Welcome! How'd you like some
tasty fried noodles?!</b>

02:52.100 --> 02:55.140
<b>Thanks for waiting. We have
some good cabbage.</b>

02:55.140 --> 02:56.910
<b>Hey, thanks, man.</b>

02:56.910 --> 02:59.410
<b>Welcome! Welcome!</b>

02:59.410 --> 03:02.440
<b>Thank you! Oh, wait a sec, please!</b>

03:02.440 --> 03:04.210
<b>Welcome!</b>

03:12.420 --> 03:15.010
<b>I guess it's already been three months</b>

03:15.690 --> 03:17.530
<b>since we came to this town.</b>

03:17.530 --> 03:22.990
<b>Yeah, and it'll be two months and
sixteen days since we started this job.</b>

03:24.930 --> 03:26.670
<b>Before we came to this town...</b>

03:26.670 --> 03:29.840
<b>No, back when we were playing
the fake Sanzo group,</b>

03:29.840 --> 03:31.700
<b>a lot of things sure happened.</b>

03:37.310 --> 03:40.650
<b>That time we almost died
was especially horrible.</b>

03:42.280 --> 03:45.650
<b>Yeah, it's a miracle we're alive.</b>

03:54.860 --> 03:58.160
<b>But now, we've got jobs.</b>

03:58.900 --> 04:02.240
<b>Aren't we the luckiest guys?</b>

04:02.240 --> 04:05.840
<b>Honest labor is the best policy,
no matter what you're doing.</b>

04:05.840 --> 04:08.580
<b>We did a lot of reckless things
and took a long detour,</b>

04:08.580 --> 04:11.940
<b>but I guess we've found a place
where we can settle down at last.</b>

04:14.680 --> 04:16.150
<b>Hello!</b>

04:16.920 --> 04:19.320
<b>Four fried noodles! On the double!</b>

04:19.320 --> 04:20.790
<b>Yes, Sir, thank you...</b>

04:23.490 --> 04:24.920
<b>What is it? What's wrong?</b>

04:28.200 --> 04:31.270
<b>I'd never forget these faces!</b>

04:31.270 --> 04:33.970
<b>That evil foursome from that time!</b>

04:33.970 --> 04:35.770
<b>They're going to kill us!</b>

04:35.770 --> 04:39.140
<b>And really brutally too!</b>

04:39.140 --> 04:41.210
<b>What could be the matter
with these people?</b>

04:41.210 --> 04:44.280
<b>It's broad daylight, and they look
as if they've seen a ghost.</b>

04:44.280 --> 04:48.250
<b>When you get customers, you're first
supposed to say, "Welcome."</b>

04:48.250 --> 04:48.750
<b>Right?</b>

04:48.750 --> 04:50.550
<b>Yes, Sir!</b>

04:50.550 --> 04:53.890
<b>Could it be that these guys...</b>

04:53.890 --> 04:56.590
<b>...haven't realized who we are?</b>

04:56.590 --> 04:58.160
<b>Fried noodles! Four of them!</b>

04:58.160 --> 04:59.790
<b>Yes, Sir!</b>

04:59.790 --> 05:01.320
<b>Thank you for waiting!</b>

05:03.930 --> 05:05.030
<b>Hey!</b>

05:05.030 --> 05:06.740
<b>Yes?</b>

05:06.740 --> 05:11.970
<b>You're not planning on serving us
warmed-over noodles, are you?</b>

05:11.970 --> 05:13.570
<b>Mercy!</b>

05:19.150 --> 05:24.950
<b>You're not planning on serving us
warmed-over noodles, are you?</b>

05:24.950 --> 05:28.650
<b>But these were made just now...</b>

05:30.730 --> 05:33.750
<b>You're not planning on serving us
warmed-over noodles...</b>

05:34.760 --> 05:37.890
<b>Of course not! I was just about
to start cooking! Right?!</b>

05:39.270 --> 05:42.140
<b>It'll be ready right away, so please
wait just a moment!</b>

05:42.140 --> 05:44.710
<b>Oh, make one a super-big serving!</b>

05:44.710 --> 05:47.010
<b>Make the noodles a bit
on the firm side.</b>

05:47.010 --> 05:50.180
<b>Plenty of green laver, please.</b>

05:50.180 --> 05:52.370
<b>Whatever, just hurry up!</b>

05:56.150 --> 05:58.620
<b>Here it is. Thank you for waiting.</b>

05:58.620 --> 06:01.560
<b>Fried noodles, fried noodles, yay!</b>

06:01.560 --> 06:04.290
<b>Thank you for coming!</b>

06:05.960 --> 06:06.760
<b>What?</b>

06:06.760 --> 06:07.530
<b>Hey.</b>

06:07.530 --> 06:08.860
<b>Yes, Sir?
Hey.</b>

06:08.860 --> 06:11.860
<b>You forgot the red pickled ginger.</b>

06:14.770 --> 06:16.000
<b>This is pretty good!</b>

06:16.000 --> 06:18.630
<b>Quit eating while you're walking,
you appetite-brain monkey.</b>

06:19.610 --> 06:21.580
<b>So, talk when you're done eating!</b>

06:21.580 --> 06:23.130
<b>Saved!</b>

06:24.180 --> 06:26.780
<b>Sanzo, you can relax now.</b>

06:26.780 --> 06:28.810
<b>It looks like the nightmare
has passed for now.</b>

06:33.560 --> 06:37.590
<b>I got some pretty good meat
for cheap today.</b>

06:37.590 --> 06:39.580
<b>I bet those guys'll be happy to hear it.</b>

06:41.700 --> 06:43.500
<b>Hey, what're you doing?!</b>

06:43.500 --> 06:46.200
<b>Pardon me, I just wasn't
paying attention.</b>

06:48.770 --> 06:50.810
<b>You dropped this.</b>

06:50.810 --> 06:53.330
<b>Or would you rather
I pay you for these?</b>

06:54.040 --> 06:56.600
<b>Pa... Pa... Pa... Pa...</b>

07:02.350 --> 07:04.250
<b>What's the matter, Hakkai?</b>

07:04.250 --> 07:06.910
<b>Oh, no, it's nothing.</b>

07:10.790 --> 07:12.790
<b>Hey, come on, it's okay, right?</b>

07:12.790 --> 07:15.600
<b>Let's go together when
we're done working.</b>

07:15.600 --> 07:18.170
<b>No, because I have plans for today.</b>

07:18.170 --> 07:19.770
<b>Then, tomorrow.</b>

07:19.770 --> 07:21.540
<b>You've got time tomorrow, right?</b>

07:21.540 --> 07:25.440
<b>I can't tomorrow either, because
there's a show I want to watch.</b>

07:25.440 --> 07:28.040
<b>Then when can you go?</b>

07:28.040 --> 07:30.610
<b>Why don't you forget about it and
actually do some work?</b>

07:30.610 --> 07:32.680
<b>The owner's going to get
mad at you again.</b>

07:32.680 --> 07:35.880
<b>What're you talking about? No one's
ever going to come to this inn...</b>

07:36.750 --> 07:38.050
<b>You got rooms?</b>

07:38.050 --> 07:39.890
<b>Welcome!</b>

07:39.890 --> 07:41.620
<b>Show these four guests to their rooms!</b>

07:42.190 --> 07:43.660
<b>What?</b>

07:44.760 --> 07:46.390
<b>Where did he go?</b>

07:47.860 --> 07:50.850
<b>I'm very sorry. I'll show you to
your rooms right away.</b>

07:52.400 --> 07:55.530
<b>Please register here in our inn book.</b>

07:56.070 --> 07:58.940
<b>Why are those guys here?</b>

08:01.180 --> 08:03.480
<b>Let go! Let me go!</b>

08:03.480 --> 08:05.880
<b>Stop it! Where the heck are you
going so suddenly?!</b>

08:05.880 --> 08:07.580
<b>Shut up!</b>

08:09.580 --> 08:11.390
<b>What the heck are you guys doing?!</b>

08:11.390 --> 08:13.420
<b>Hey, just the guy I wanted to see!</b>

08:13.420 --> 08:15.020
<b>You help me stop him too!</b>

08:15.020 --> 08:18.890
<b>Let go! The Devil comes
to play his pipes!</b>

08:18.890 --> 08:22.530
<b>Don't tell me you guys saw the
apocalypse from Hell too?!</b>

08:22.530 --> 08:24.170
<b>You too?!</b>

08:24.170 --> 08:25.730
<b>I'm done for.</b>

08:25.730 --> 08:28.000
<b>I can't ever make fried noodles again.</b>

08:29.240 --> 08:33.710
<b>I'm human scum! That's why
they're going to kill me!</b>

08:33.710 --> 08:36.040
<b>That's right! That's got to be it!</b>

08:36.040 --> 08:39.750
<b>They forced him to make
fried noodles for them.</b>

08:39.750 --> 08:42.080
<b>He's been like that ever since.</b>

08:42.080 --> 08:45.720
<b>Poor guy, the terror's been rubbed
into his brain,</b>

08:45.720 --> 08:49.320
<b>and now, he's become physically
unable to make fried noodles.</b>

08:49.320 --> 08:52.330
<b>I can't blame him. If I were
in his place,</b>

08:52.330 --> 08:54.600
<b>I'd probably be going through
the same thing right now.</b>

08:54.600 --> 08:58.730
<b>Anyway, we better quietly stay
indoors for a couple of days.</b>

08:58.730 --> 09:01.760
<b>Yeah, don't go troubling trouble,
and trouble won't trouble you.</b>

09:03.840 --> 09:05.930
<b>Are we just going to let it go?!</b>

09:06.670 --> 09:09.880
<b>Are we just going to let them get
away with beating us up?!</b>

09:09.880 --> 09:11.810
<b>Don't be unreasonable.</b>

09:11.810 --> 09:15.550
<b>You know very well how
terrible they are too!</b>

09:15.550 --> 09:18.320
<b>We could never win against them
in a head-on fight.</b>

09:18.320 --> 09:22.160
<b>You idiots! Don't you guys
have any pride?!</b>

09:22.160 --> 09:24.660
<b>We were a first-rate imposter
Sanzo group!</b>

09:24.660 --> 09:26.160
<b>Are we going to let those
third-rate imposters</b>

09:26.160 --> 09:28.660
<b>just get away with the beating
they gave us?!</b>

09:28.660 --> 09:32.600
<b>Don't you guys have any pride
in being first-rate?!</b>

09:32.600 --> 09:34.700
<b>But you know...</b>

09:34.700 --> 09:36.800
<b>Easy for you to say...</b>

09:36.800 --> 09:38.270
<b>It's still...</b>

09:38.840 --> 09:40.740
<b>Fine then, I ain't asking anymore.</b>

09:44.210 --> 09:46.810
<b>I'll do it, even if I have to do it alone.</b>

09:59.690 --> 10:01.160
<b>As if they'd come.</b>

10:15.280 --> 10:17.680
<b>This crab fried rice is yummy!</b>

10:17.680 --> 10:20.920
<b>Those fried noodles were good, but
the food here is super-good too!</b>

10:20.920 --> 10:22.250
<b>Don't you think so, Gojyo?!</b>

10:22.250 --> 10:26.090
<b>Don't ask me. You ended up eating</b>

10:26.090 --> 10:28.850
<b>all four servings of those
fried noodles by yourself!</b>

10:32.130 --> 10:35.220
<b>If you're not going to listen,
don't start a conversation!</b>

10:36.930 --> 10:38.800
<b>Hey, gimme back my shaomai!</b>

10:38.800 --> 10:40.940
<b>It's payback for the fried noodles
you ate earlier.</b>

10:40.940 --> 10:44.540
<b>That's not funny! I was
saving it for last!</b>

10:44.540 --> 10:46.470
<b>Give it here, you thieving water sprite!</b>

10:46.470 --> 10:49.580
<b>Shuddup! If you want it that bad,
I dare you to take it from me,</b>

10:49.580 --> 10:51.510
<b>monkey with a stomach for a brain!</b>

10:51.510 --> 10:52.780
<b>You bastard!</b>

10:52.780 --> 10:54.350
<b>Hey, you shorty!</b>

10:54.350 --> 10:56.650
<b>Hey, there you go!</b>

10:56.650 --> 10:57.720
<b>I feel so futile.</b>

10:57.720 --> 11:00.990
<b>You bastard, gimme back the shaomai!</b>

11:00.990 --> 11:04.010
<b>Shut up! You two want to see
what it's like to die?!</b>

11:05.290 --> 11:06.730
<b>I'll pass.</b>

11:09.000 --> 11:09.930
<b>What's the matter?</b>

11:09.930 --> 11:12.260
<b>Oh, no, nothing.</b>

11:15.270 --> 11:17.430
<b>Where did we see them before?</b>

11:33.050 --> 11:36.550
<b>The sky looks so vast today.</b>

11:42.960 --> 11:45.460
<b>This town feels so surreal.</b>

11:50.370 --> 11:55.240
<b>I work and I work, but my life
doesn't get easier.</b>

11:57.910 --> 12:00.180
<b>Those old days were so great.</b>

12:08.720 --> 12:10.450
<b>It brings back memories.</b>

12:25.570 --> 12:27.840
<b>Go away! Go away! Go away!</b>

13:10.080 --> 13:14.210
<b>I never thought I'd wear these again.</b>

13:24.870 --> 13:26.330
<b>Now, then...</b>

13:27.200 --> 13:31.430
<b>I'm gonna put on one hell of a show
and go out with a bang.</b>

13:32.310 --> 13:33.770
<b>I guess.</b>

13:48.660 --> 13:51.690
<b>Hey, hey, acting cool by yourself</b>

13:51.690 --> 13:53.220
<b>will only get you killed for nothing.</b>

14:01.140 --> 14:02.400
<b>Yo!</b>

14:02.400 --> 14:03.440
<b>Gojyo!</b>

14:03.440 --> 14:05.870
<b>I can't have you forgetting me now.</b>

14:10.040 --> 14:11.310
<b>Delicious.</b>

14:11.310 --> 14:12.710
<b>Hakkai...</b>

14:12.710 --> 14:14.270
<b>It seems everyone's here.</b>

14:15.080 --> 14:16.580
<b>It had been so long,</b>

14:16.580 --> 14:20.020
<b>I had a little trouble changing
into these.</b>

14:20.020 --> 14:22.110
<b>Sanzo!</b>

14:26.790 --> 14:28.860
<b>Hey, hey, don't cry.</b>

14:28.860 --> 14:31.070
<b>But... But...</b>

14:31.070 --> 14:35.400
<b>I guess, in the end, this
is what suits us best.</b>

14:35.400 --> 14:38.840
<b>Let's go! We'll show them the pride
of first-rate fakes!</b>

14:38.840 --> 14:40.310
<b>Wait!</b>

14:41.280 --> 14:44.110
<b>It's true, those bastards are strong.</b>

14:44.110 --> 14:48.100
<b>Alone, I had to resign myself to
an honorable death.</b>

14:49.220 --> 14:52.620
<b>But if we four join forces,</b>

14:52.620 --> 14:55.250
<b>we aren't without means
to fight against them.</b>

14:56.120 --> 14:58.720
<b>Would you all leave this to me?</b>

14:59.690 --> 15:02.220
<b>So, gentlemen, lend me your ears.</b>

15:04.900 --> 15:07.640
<b>Oh, oh, I see, I see.</b>

15:07.640 --> 15:10.710
<b>Well, that is something.</b>

15:10.710 --> 15:12.260
<b>And for the finishing touch...</b>

15:14.240 --> 15:16.230
<b>That's great.</b>

15:17.280 --> 15:19.510
<b>Then everyone, take up your positions!</b>

15:19.510 --> 15:20.980
<b>Yeah!</b>

15:43.240 --> 15:44.700
<b>Sanzo...</b>

15:46.110 --> 15:48.340
<b>It seems we have visitors.</b>

15:48.340 --> 15:50.410
<b>They think we'll have our guards down
when we're asleep,</b>

15:50.410 --> 15:52.080
<b>so they come to attack us.</b>

15:52.080 --> 15:54.380
<b>They all do the same thing.</b>

16:01.420 --> 16:03.990
<b>It seems the enemy consists
of more than one.</b>

16:03.990 --> 16:07.430
<b>Damn disturbers of sleep, I'll beat
the crap out of them.</b>

16:13.400 --> 16:14.870
<b>My shaomai...</b>

16:16.540 --> 16:18.040
<b>Hey, Sanzo and company!</b>

16:18.040 --> 16:19.640
<b>Pay up! You eat-and-run bastards!</b>

16:19.640 --> 16:21.480
<b>Grow up already, you damn shoplifters!</b>

16:21.480 --> 16:24.410
<b>How dare you pull up my skirt?!</b>

16:28.720 --> 16:30.520
<b>What the heck is this?</b>

16:30.520 --> 16:33.390
<b>It seems to be a case
of mistaken identity.</b>

16:35.660 --> 16:37.760
<b>Gimme back my shaomai.</b>

16:37.760 --> 16:39.280
<b>Shut up, you stupid monkey!</b>

16:43.800 --> 16:46.570
<b>But it certainly went well!</b>

16:46.570 --> 16:50.370
<b>They're probably in a cage getting
beat up about now.</b>

16:50.370 --> 16:55.140
<b>We do whatever we want, and
they'll pay for all our crimes!</b>

16:55.140 --> 16:56.480
<b>How do you like that?!</b>

16:56.480 --> 17:00.310
<b>I'm finally beginning to feel I can
get a fresh start again.</b>

17:00.310 --> 17:05.750
<b>It's a pity we can never eat the
Chinese at that restaurant again.</b>

17:05.750 --> 17:08.220
<b>Those shaomai were so delicious.</b>

17:08.220 --> 17:11.020
<b>Damn it, I wanted to eat shaomai too!</b>

17:14.960 --> 17:16.330
<b>It's them!</b>

17:16.330 --> 17:17.470
<b>Why're they here?!</b>

17:17.470 --> 17:19.830
<b>Your voices can be heard
throughout the village</b>

17:19.830 --> 17:21.600
<b>when you speak so loudly
late at night.</b>

17:21.600 --> 17:25.570
<b>We told you before. It's dangerous
to impersonate us.</b>

17:25.570 --> 17:28.480
<b>How dare you lay your
petty crimes on us?</b>

17:28.480 --> 17:30.340
<b>Don't think you'll get away with it!</b>

17:30.340 --> 17:32.550
<b>Mercy!</b>

17:32.550 --> 17:34.010
<b>Say your prayers!</b>

17:39.650 --> 17:41.620
<b>Man, that was stupid.</b>

17:41.620 --> 17:45.060
<b>It felt like we were bullies,
leaves a bad taste in my mouth.</b>

17:45.060 --> 17:48.220
<b>I could've had more fun
if I weren't so hungry.</b>

17:49.830 --> 17:51.400
<b>Saved...</b>

17:51.400 --> 17:57.400
<b>I guess gods do exist. I thought we
were goners for sure this time.</b>

17:57.400 --> 18:00.470
<b>We better be grateful to the gods.</b>

18:00.470 --> 18:04.430
<b>We're already used to
this kind of thing.</b>

18:05.550 --> 18:07.480
<b>It's too soon to feel relief just yet!</b>

18:10.920 --> 18:13.280
<b>How dare you gyp me?!</b>

18:15.120 --> 18:18.960
<b>You're gonna pay for what you took!
In a different way!</b>

18:18.960 --> 18:21.600
<b>You know what's coming, don't you?!</b>

18:21.600 --> 18:24.260
<b>Mercy!</b>

18:29.770 --> 18:32.040
<b>Don't you ever come back
to this village again!</b>

18:32.040 --> 18:35.840
<b>You won't get off so light if you show
your face around here again!</b>

18:35.840 --> 18:37.310
<b>You morons!</b>

18:38.550 --> 18:41.980
<b>Hey, you guys alive?</b>

18:41.980 --> 18:43.950
<b>Just barely...</b>

18:43.950 --> 18:47.720
<b>That really got to me this time.</b>

18:47.720 --> 18:53.130
<b>But don't you think we've finally
become ourselves again?</b>

18:53.130 --> 18:55.030
<b>That's true.</b>

18:55.030 --> 19:00.730
<b>In the end, doing honest, hard work
just doesn't suit us.</b>

19:00.730 --> 19:05.840
<b>I guess it just means life is more fun
when there's risk involved.</b>

19:05.840 --> 19:08.140
<b>No matter what petty way
of life you lead,</b>

19:08.140 --> 19:11.910
<b>you must never discard your pride.</b>

19:11.910 --> 19:15.850
<b>I'm going to live the rest of my life
as a Hakkai imposter,</b>

19:15.850 --> 19:19.480
<b>with pride enough to match
even the real Hakkai.</b>

19:20.550 --> 19:22.460
<b>Bastard, what the hell are you doing?!</b>

19:22.460 --> 19:25.360
<b>I was feeling good here!</b>

19:25.360 --> 19:28.930
<b>Sorry, I didn't see you in the dark.</b>

19:28.930 --> 19:32.070
<b>Hey, that's real funny, man!</b>

19:32.070 --> 19:35.370
<b>Just who the hell do you think
we are, you moron?!</b>

19:35.370 --> 19:37.710
<b>We're the famous Sanzo group</b>

19:37.710 --> 19:40.610
<b>that has demons running barefoot
at the mere mention of our name!</b>

19:40.610 --> 19:41.580
<b>Scared now?!</b>

19:41.580 --> 19:45.350
<b>Really, you're the Sanzo party?</b>

19:45.350 --> 19:47.510
<b>Oh! You are...</b>

19:51.820 --> 19:54.320
<b>What a waste of time.</b>

19:54.320 --> 19:56.290
<b>That's so weird!</b>

19:56.290 --> 20:00.390
<b>I was sure I smelled bald-Sanzo.</b>

20:00.390 --> 20:03.830
<b>Let's go! We'll catch their idiocy
if we hang around those guys!</b>

20:05.630 --> 20:07.300
<b>It...</b>

20:07.300 --> 20:08.770
<b>It hurts...</b>

20:09.470 --> 20:13.910
<b>It hurts so much, I almost don't care
about pride anymore.</b>

20:13.910 --> 20:15.980
<b>If it's between life and pride,</b>

20:15.980 --> 20:19.010
<b>I'd have to say life is more important.</b>

20:19.010 --> 20:22.380
<b>After all, you have to be alive
to have a life.</b>

20:23.250 --> 20:26.920
<b>Hakkai, you okay?</b>

20:26.920 --> 20:29.910
<b>I might be done for.</b>

20:31.260 --> 20:36.130
<b>Let's quit dressing up like this
for real this time.</b>

20:36.130 --> 20:38.720
<b>Agreed.</b>

20:49.580 --> 20:58.420
<b>Yukikau hito wa mina
omoi nimotsu seotte</b>

20:59.750 --> 21:10.190
<b>Touku ni yureru kagerou no naka ni
ashita o mitsukeru</b>

21:11.530 --> 21:21.670
<b>Kono te o kobore-ochiru
suna no you na kanjou</b>

21:22.980 --> 21:35.990
<b>Ano toki mune ni sasatta
kotoba ga fui ni uzuku kedo</b>

21:35.990 --> 21:47.430
<b>Hatenai yoru o kazoenagara
jibun no kakera sagashite ita</b>

21:47.430 --> 21:58.710
<b>Ushinau hodo ni kono omoi ga
tashika ni natteku</b>

21:58.710 --> 22:10.890
<b>ima nara kitto aruite yukeru
doko made mo</b>
